      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BINNAWAY PEARL (4) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to fill the minor placings over 342m at Angle Park (19.68) in a Grade 5. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of 11 starts. The form out of her last race has been franked. One of the contenders. OUTSHINE (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with nine wins and 12 minors from 27 tries. In the money last time at this track (19.46) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 1.75 lengths third. Looks a key chance on best figures. SECRET SUPER (8) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (17.11) at Murray Bridge Straight. One of the main contenders. TECHNO KELLI (6) is always a threat when she draws this box.",
